# The Docker build context (Dockerfile). Dependencies are installed and the dashboard is built
# inside the image; local databases, secrets, Git history and the documentation (docs/,
# screenshots included; the agent documents the API serves are in apps/api/src/agentDocs) stay
# out.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-static
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
.git
.github
apps/web/static-data/bundle.json
docs
